+# PG_DUMP_BIN=<absolute path - see above>
+# PG_RESTORE_BIN=<absolute path - see above>
+# Largest release ZIP the upload endpoint accepts, in MB (1-2048, default 200). A reverse proxy in front of the application has its own limit that this does not change.
